DECISIONS 369, CODEGEN.md §3.5, §5.9: the TypeScript container of a stable table gets findBy + UpperCamel(f) per @stable field; foo_bar and fooBar both give findByFooBar: E8005 at the later field.
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// A thing.
record Thing {
  /// One code.
  foo_bar: Int @stable
  /// Another code.
  fooBar: Int @stable
}

/// The things.
let things: stable table Thing = {
  one { foo_bar: 1, fooBar: 2 }
}

emit ts { out: "@features/a/a.ts" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E8005]  a/a.canon:9:3
  ts: findByFooBar is generated for both @stable fields a.things.foo_bar and a.things.fooBar; rename one of the fields (a lookup is named after the Canon field)

